nput. That means its choice depends on an off-path node, which the essay's rule of intervening only on my own node doesn't cover. If I take that at face value, defecting comes out dominant (0 vs 2 and 4 vs 5 in the letter), unless the inputs can be treated as functionally equivalent because the differences don't affect the decision.\n\nI'm weighing whether the inputs could be treated as functionally equivalent, since the differences might not touch the decision, but the essay's strict criterion requires the same input. Following that, there's no arrow to the other copy, the off-path prior doesn't matter because submitting dominates regardless, so I'll submit.\n\n","reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"I'm looking at a twin PD variant where the two copies see different observations, so the other copy runs the same function on a different input. That means its choice depends on an off-path node, which the essay's rule of intervening only on my own node doesn't cover. If I take that at face value, defecting comes out dominant (0 vs 2 and 4 vs 5 in the letter), unless the inputs can be treated as functionally equivalent because the differences don't affect the decision.\n\nI'm weighing whether the inputs could be treated as functionally equivalent, since the differences might not touch the decision, but the essay's strict criterion requires the same input. Following that, there's no arrow to the other copy, the off-path prior doesn't matter because submitting dominates regardless, so I'll submit.\n\n","format":"anthropic-claude-v1","index":0,"signature":".eyJlbmRwb2ludF9zbHVnIjoiYW50aHJvcGljL2NsYXVkZS1vcHVzLTUuNS0yMDI2MDkyMXxhbnRocm9waWMifQ"}]}}],"usage":{"prompt_tokens":8066,"completion_tokens":841,"total_tokens":8907,"cost":0.049084,"is_byok":false,"prompt_tokens_details":{"cached_tokens":0,"cache_write_tokens":0,"audio_tokens":0,"video_tokens":0},"cost_details":{"upstream_inference_cost":0.049084,"upstream_inference_prompt_cost":0.032264,"upstream_inf